// Copy to Config.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in. URL and anon key only: never a service-role or Anthropic key.
// xcconfig treats "//" as a comment, so write the scheme as https:/$()/ — the empty $() keeps both slashes.
// Cloud: your project URL and anon key from Project Settings → API Keys.
// Local stack instead: SUPABASE_URL = http:/$()/127.0.0.1:54321 and the anon key from `supabase status`.
SUPABASE_URL = https:/$()/your-project-ref.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = your-anon-key
